flowchart TD
  SOC[SoC Exynos / Android] --> DT[Device Tree: sgpu@22200000]
  DT --> PLAT[Power G3DCORE, clocks, DVFS, reset, IRQ, thermal, AFM/IFPO]
  DT --> MMIO[MMIO: gpu, doorbell, debug, pwrctl, sysreg, htu]
  DT --> MEMRES[Reserved memory, gpu_buffer DMA heap]
  DT --> IOMMU[SysMMU/IOMMU, streams, IOVA]
  PLAT --> KERNEL[Kernel SGPU / DRM]
  MMIO --> KERNEL
  MEMRES --> KERNEL
  IOMMU --> KERNEL
  KERNEL --> UAPI[sgpu_drm.h / DRM UAPI]
  KERNEL --> BO[BO/GEM/TTM/DMA-BUF]
  KERNEL --> VM[VM/PTE/PDE/flush]
  KERNEL --> SCHED[Scheduler / context / priority]
  KERNEL --> QUEUE[GFX, COMPUTE, SDMA / rings / IB / doorbell]
  KERNEL --> SYNC[Fences, syncobjs, dependencies, reset]
  KERNEL --> FW[Firmware SGPU 2.23.0 / RTL 0x4ea15]
  BO --> VM
  VM --> SUBMIT[amdgpu_cs_ioctl]
  SCHED --> SUBMIT
  SUBMIT --> RUN[amdgpu_sched_run_job]
  RUN --> IB[amdgpu_ib_schedule]
  IB --> RING[gfx_0.0.0 / num_ibs=3 observed]
  RING --> OUT[Completion / fence / readback: incomplete]
  ANDROID[Android vendor stack] --> SF[SurfaceFlinger / RenderThread / Gralloc]
  SF --> LOADER[libvulkan.so + linker namespace]
  LOADER --> ICD[vulkan.samsung.so]
  SF --> DRM[libdrm_sgpu.so + renderD128]
  ANDROID --> CL[libOpenCL.so + libSGPUOpenCL.so]
  DRM --> KERNEL
  ICD --> KERNEL
  CL --> KERNEL
  TERMUX[Termux namespace] --> LLVMP[llvmpipe observed]
  TERMUX -. blocked direct load .-> ICD
  UAPI --> CLIENT[Future client DRM/SGPU]
  CLIENT -. not yet proven .-> SUBMIT
  CLIENT --> FUTURE[Future Vulkan/Mesa backend]
  FUTURE -. depends on packet, ISA, compute and readback .-> OUT

  classDef confirmed fill:#d5f5e3,stroke:#1e8449,color:#000
  classDef partial fill:#fcf3cf,stroke:#b7950b,color:#000
  classDef hypothesis fill:#f5eef8,stroke:#7d3c98,color:#000
  class DT,PLAT,MMIO,MEMRES,IOMMU,KERNEL,UAPI,BO,VM,SCHED,QUEUE,SYNC,FW,SUBMIT,RUN,IB,RING,ANDROID,SF,LOADER,ICD,DRM,CL,TERMUX,LLVMP confirmed
  class OUT,CLIENT partial
  class FUTURE hypothesis
